{"detail": {"templateUuid": "5d3380e1a676433099dcad70664f7855", "projectUuid": "228a3aaf183840b8b5ffa29a412f1248", "name": "《THE TURN 回合：当游戏规则被改写，我们能走出第13种结局》", "description": "《THE TURN》｜回合\n\n当规则只允许一个赢家，他们能否找到另一种结束游戏的方式？\n\n导演／音乐设计／调色：AKINO\n音乐制作／空间设计：Karl\n制片／监制：SUN\n美术设计：AKINO & Karl\n\nTHE TURN\nA dispute over a marker leads three children into a civilization-building board game.\nAs they build cities and compete for resources, their choices begin to carry a human cost.\nWhen the rules allow only one winner, can they find another way to end the game?\nA science-fiction short about competition, power, and the possibility of sharing.\n\n404 STUDIO · Directed by AKINO", "coverUrl": "/assets/bca9ebafa5e1134b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/da510f1e709342eb83073c123ed984ea/4ac1c6ba46d7d78827c8ec44757fe1c191ffb4ad.mp4", "snapshotId": 46173, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 11387232, "ownerUuid": "da510f1e709342eb83073c123ed984ea", "avatar": "/assets/fe766b1ad4a79e1b.webp", "nickname": "404_STUDIO", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 63, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3060, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3. 盗梦空间", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3060", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xinpianchang.com/a13808333?from=webShare&channel=copyLink", "createAt": "2026年09月09日 14:26", "updateAt": "2026年09月17日 20:00", "publishAt": "2026年09月14日 16:04", "playCount": 101, "viewCreationProcessCount": 45, "copyCanvasCount": 4, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/5d3380e1a6764330